msgctxt "answer"
msgid "Good f*cking morning!"
msgstr "Good f*cking morning!"

msgctxt "answer"
msgid "Good morning! Wake up, stretch, smile, perk up and greet the new day! Hooray!"
msgstr "Good morning! Wake up, stretch, smile, perk up and greet the new day! Hooray!"

msgctxt "answer"
msgid ""
"Good morning! Wishing you a great mood, plenty of energy and success with all your "
"plans."
msgstr ""
"Good morning! Wishing you a great mood, plenty of energy and success with all your "
"plans."

msgctxt "answer"
msgid "Good morning, and welcome to a new day! May it be easy, cheerful and productive."
msgstr "Good morning, and welcome to a new day! May it be easy, cheerful and productive."

msgctxt "answer"
msgid "May your guardian angel watch over you while you sleep"
msgstr "May your guardian angel watch over you while you sleep"

msgctxt "answer"
msgid ""
"May your morning be kind, fragrant and refreshing! And may your whole week be easy, "
"inspiring and productive!"
msgstr ""
"May your morning be kind, fragrant and refreshing! And may your whole week be easy, "
"inspiring and productive!"

msgctxt "answer"
msgid "One hour in the morning is worth two in the evening. Tajik proverb"
msgstr "One hour in the morning is worth two in the evening. Tajik proverb"

msgctxt "answer"
msgid "Sleep is a reflection of our heart and soul"
msgstr "Sleep is a reflection of our heart and soul"

msgctxt "answer"
msgid "Time to say goodbye, but only for today"
msgstr "Time to say goodbye, but only for today"

msgctxt "answer"
msgid "Today was a great day, but tomorrow, as always, will be even better"
msgstr "Today was a great day, but tomorrow, as always, will be even better"

msgctxt "answer"
msgid "What you leave undone in the morning, you cannot make up for in the evening."
msgstr "What you leave undone in the morning, you cannot make up for in the evening."

msgctxt "answer"
msgid "Wishing you a kind, energetic, positive, sunny, wonderful, joyful and happy morning!"
msgstr "Wishing you a kind, energetic, positive, sunny, wonderful, joyful and happy morning!"
